      "@type": "Attestation",
      "schema:name": "The consulted source reports that Pedro Lantzas was an agent of the Spanish in the service of the Spanish crown in the realm of the Kingdom of Naples, as revealed through his secret conversations with the count of Miranda, viceroy of Naples (1586-1595), during the period of 1595 when the sultan called Peribei to Constantinople to join the diván.",
